        "text_tNNyqd": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Founded in 2013 by Craig Marquette, CBM Marketing, Inc. In Sarasota, Florida, has carved a niche in the retail sector by offering customized plastic bottles to the DIY community through prominent platforms like Amazon. However, the journey to success was not without its hurdles.</p><p>One of the primary challenges was finding a label supplier capable of catering to the diverse demands of its customers’ products while staying within budget constraints.</p><p><strong>NADCO Tapes & Labels</strong> emerged as the all-in-one solution they were looking for. This case study details their collaborative efforts and showcases the results of their enduring partnership.</p>",
