        "text_4bK8WP": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Initially, CBM Marketing collaborated with a label supplier who claimed to have an art department but was, in reality, using an independent contractor. This arrangement led to communication difficulties, uninspired artwork, and unattractive labels. </p><p>Moreover, the mismatch between the labels and bottle materials posed installation challenges, risking costly errors.</p><p>Marquette soon realized they needed a label supplier with a dedicated art department and production facility that could offer seamless end-to-end service. </p><p>They also wanted reasonable pricing without compromising quality, consistency, and reliability.</p>",
            "subtext_color": false
          }
        }
      },
