        "text_Ttph8F": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Upon referral, CBM Marketing turned to NADCO for a solution to its labeling woes. NADCO’s expertise and resources enabled them to design, produce, and support the required labels efficiently, ensuring both quality and cost-effectiveness.</p><p>First and foremost, they were assigned a skilled, in-house graphic artist who delivered high-quality designs that would elevate the aesthetic appeal of their customers’ products.</p><p>Additionally, NADCO went beyond mere production. They tailored solutions to CBM Marketing’s specific requirements, supporting challenges ranging from label installation to material compatibility.</p><p>This meticulous attention to detail ensured that installation processes proceeded smoothly, averting potential costly mishaps down the line.</p>",
            "subtext_color": false
          }
        }
      },
