        "text_3zVhtX": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>The collaboration with NADCO brought substantial improvements for Marquette and his team. Transitioning from a chaotic process to a streamlined, professional approach significantly enhanced the company’s brand image and product presentation. </p><p>With attractive and well-matched labels, they could effectively differentiate their products from those of their competitors. NADCO’s commitment to competitive pricing enabled them to maintain cost efficiency without compromising quality. </p><p>Today, CBM Marketing’s label requirements have grown to 100,000 labels across four styles annually. NADCO’s ability to understand and adapt to their needs continues to drive their mutual success. </p>",
